@Fortuity.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5015

### Health probe
GET {{Fortuity.Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### List customers
GET {{Fortuity.Api_HostAddress}}/api/customers
Accept: application/json

### Customer detail with policies
GET {{Fortuity.Api_HostAddress}}/api/customers/CUST-100001
Accept: application/json

### Draft a quote (rates on the customer's preferred basis)
POST {{Fortuity.Api_HostAddress}}/api/quotes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerNumber": "CUST-100001",
  "policyType": "Motor",
  "coverage": "Standard",
  "ageYears": 5,
  "noClaimsYears": 5
}

### Quick indication — Local basis
POST {{Fortuity.Api_HostAddress}}/api/quotes/indication
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "policyType": "Motor",
  "coverage": "Standard",
  "region": "FI-01",
  "basis": "Local",
  "ageYears": 5,
  "noClaimsYears": 5
}

### Quick indication — Nordic basis (same inputs, different tariff)
POST {{Fortuity.Api_HostAddress}}/api/quotes/indication
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "policyType": "Motor",
  "coverage": "Standard",
  "region": "FI-01",
  "basis": "Nordic",
  "ageYears": 5,
  "noClaimsYears": 5
}

### Register a claim (FNOL)
POST {{Fortuity.Api_HostAddress}}/api/claims
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "policyNumber": "POL-2026-000002",
  "type": "Collision",
  "incidentDate": "2026-07-15"
}

### List open claims
GET {{Fortuity.Api_HostAddress}}/api/claims/open
Accept: application/json

###
